{"signature": "{\"text\": \"At the top, the skier has gravitational potential energy relative to the bottom of the slope. As the skier descends, gravity transfers energy mechanically, decreasing the gravitational potential energy store and increasing the kinetic energy store. Friction and air resistance also transfer energy to the internal energy stores of the skis, snow and air. Sound can carry some energy away.\", \"voice\": \"en-NG-AbeoNeural\", \"rate\": \"-4%\", \"eleven\": false}", "duration": 24.816, "words": [["At", 0.102083], ["the", 0.284375], ["top,", 0.440625], ["the", 0.948458], ["skier", 1.039583], ["has", 1.352083], ["gravitational", 1.625541], ["potential", 2.341666], ["energy", 2.888541], ["relative", 3.279166], ["to", 3.747916], ["the", 3.878125], ["bottom", 4.021375], ["of", 4.333875], ["the", 4.490125], ["slope.", 4.620333], ["As", 5.976583], ["the", 6.223958], ["skier", 6.341166], ["descends,", 6.70575], ["gravity", 7.526041], ["transfers", 7.96875], ["energy", 8.515625], ["mechanically,", 8.880208], ["decreasing", 9.84375], ["the", 10.3125], ["gravitational", 10.429708], ["potential", 11.132833], ["energy", 11.679708], ["store", 12.096375], ["and", 12.317708], ["increasing", 12.487], ["the", 12.994791], ["kinetic", 13.138041], ["energy", 13.619791], ["store.", 14.036458], ["Friction", 15.2995], ["and", 15.76825], ["air", 15.950541], ["resistance", 16.119791], ["also", 16.71875], ["transfer", 17.057291], ["energy", 17.513041], ["to", 17.942708], ["the", 18.072916], ["internal", 18.164083], ["energy", 18.645833], ["stores", 19.075541], ["of", 19.362], ["the", 19.505208], ["skis,", 19.635416], ["snow", 20.247416], ["and", 20.677083], ["air.", 20.859375], ["Sound", 22.01825], ["can", 22.408875], ["carry", 22.617208], ["some", 22.877625], ["energy", 23.112], ["away.", 23.502625]], "raw": [{"text": "At", "start": 0.102083, "end": 0.24533299999999997}, {"text": "the", "start": 0.284375, "end": 0.375541}, {"text": "top", "start": 0.440625, "end": 0.675